## Why This Is Asked

Interview context explanation.

## Key Concepts

- WebSocket backpressure and reconnection strategies
- Batched DOM updates via a render queue
- Service Worker caching: stale-while-revalidate for REST/assets
- BroadcastChannel for cross-tab sync
